{"id":"2023-505486-92-00","src":"ctis","title":"ENGIC 02 - PRODIGE 86-FOLFIRINOX SBA- Phase II randomized trial evaluating modified FOLFIRINOX and FOLFOX in the treatment of locally advanced or metastatic small bowel adenocarcinoma","official":"ENGIC 02 - PRODIGE 86-FOLFIRINOX SBA- Phase II randomized trial evaluating modified FOLFIRINOX and FOLFOX in the treatment of locally advanced or metastatic small bowel adenocarcinoma","summary":"Main objective: Assessment of the percentage of patients alive without progression at 8 months","conditions":["Small bowel adenocarcinoma"],"interventions":[{"type":"DRUG","name":"CALCIUM LEVOFOLINATE"},{"type":"DRUG","name":"OXALIPLATIN"},{"type":"DRUG","name":"FLUOROURACIL"},{"type":"DRUG","name":"IRINOTECAN HYDROCHLORIDE TRIHYDRATE"}],"criteria":"Inclusion criteria:\n1. Histologically proven adenocarcinoma of the small intestine (duodenum, jejunum, ileum)\n2. Metastatic or locally advanced unresectable tumour with curative intent\n3. Patient who never received first-line chemotherapy\n4. Measurable lesion according to RECIST 1.1 criteria\n5. ECOG status < or = 2 for patients under 70 years, or 0 or 1 for patients over 70 years\n6. Life expectancy estimated at over 3 months\nExclusion criteria:\n1. MSI/dMMR tumor\n2. Treatment with a cytochrome P450 inhibitor within 4 weeks prior to the administration of the protocol treatment\n3. Uncontrolled inflammatory bowel disease and/or unresolved bowel obstruction\n4. Administration of live vaccines within 28 days prior to randomization\n5. Adenocarcinoma of the ampulla of Vater\n6. Neutrophils < 1500/mm3, platelets < 100 000/mm3\n7. Hemoglobin < 9 g/dL, total bilirubin > 1.5x normal, alkaline phosphatase > 2.5x normal (or >5x normal if liver metastases), creatinine clearance > or = 40 ml/min. according to MDRD\n8. Adjuvant chemotherapy completed less than 6 months ago\n9. History of myocardial infarction within the last 6 months, severe coronary artery disease or severe heart failure\n10. 